Both verified against primary sources:
- CSC/Imperial Enterprise Lab: apps open 3 Aug–1 Sep 2026, Accra bootcamp Jan 2027, London capstone May 2027, up to £2,000 equity-free (NOT £35k — that is the total Fellows Fund pool)
- SMEDAN CGS on smedan.gov.ng: ₦50,000, nano/micro at LGA level, must employ one additional worker, portal.smedan.gov.ng

